  "body": "There is an ambiguity in the SSE syntax:\r\n\r\n\"data: 1\\ndata: 2\\n\\n\" is a well-formed event\r\n\r\n\"data: 1\\rdata: 2\\r\\r\" is also a well-formed event\r\n\r\n\"data: 1\\rdata: 2\\r\\n\" is ambiguous; could be field+field or field+field+end-of-line\r\n",
